  "body": "The test `egui_app::tests::stock_fit::stock_fit_controls_follow_the_selected_shape` in the `camcraft-ui` lib suite fails on `main` (tip `4b7a6b1e8`).\n\nEvidence:\n- The test calls `h.get_by_label(\"Delete\")` on the Stock page.\n- The failure message says two or more nodes have the label \"Delete\".\n- The two nodes are the Stock page button (`stock_page.rs`) and the ribbon Delete button.\n- PR #2081 (`fix(ui): give painted ribbon cells and dropdowns AccessKit nodes`) gave the ribbon cells AccessKit nodes. The test was green before that merge batch.\n- Reproduced with `cargo xtask gate test stock_fit_controls_follow_the_selected_shape --crate camcraft-ui`.\n\nCause: the test lookup is not exact. Both buttons are real controls with the correct label. The test must select the button in the Properties pane.\n\nDone means: the test passes on `main`, the assertions are not weakened, and the rest of the `camcraft-ui` lib suite is checked for other failures.\n",
